        <p>You! What are you thinking of buying for Christmas ? Let us suggest an Umbrella or a Walking Stick. - • It need not be an expensive one, it is just a question of commonsense design and careful work- manship. We have hundreds of elegant and attractive designs. FROM 1/3 TO 63/.. As we are Specialists in Umbrella Manufacture our designs combine smartness with real serviceability. —CALL and inspect our big stock TO-DAY J. WILSON &amp;Co Umbrella Specialists, 48, HORSEMARKET STREET. WARRINGTON.</p>
